  "description": "If we were to meet on the premise of marriage, we should know each other’s desires and desires well,” he whispered to Seowoo affectionately. “If you’re so scared beforehand, you feel like I’ll have to do something.” “You… You’re crazy.” “I’m sorry to hear you now.” As she guessed, Kang Tae-yoon was somewhat crazy.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/62626239), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%A7%90%EC%8A%B9%EC%9D%98-%EB%B0%9C%EC%9E%90%EA%B5%AD/3707)\n\n**Official Translations:**    \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/207075)",
